OL,4,CItaly's former police chief rejected   
OL,5,Cmafia inquiry allegations before death 
OL,6,GItalian ex-police chief Gianni De      
OL,7,GGennaro has denied misleading          
OL,8,Ginvestigations into high-profile Mafia 
OL,9,Gkillings, in a letter written shortly  
OL,10,Gbefore his death.                      
OL,12,FHis body was found at his Tuscan       
OL,13,Fcountry home on Saturday and Italian   
OL,14,Fauthorities believe he took his own    
OL,15,Flife. A post mortem examination was    
OL,16,Fdue to take place on Friday.           
OL,18,FIn his eight-page note, De Gennaro,    
OL,19,F78, vehemently denied obstructing the  
OL,20,Finquiry into the murder of anti-mafia  
OL,21,Fjudge Paolo Borsellino in Sicily in    
OL,22,FJuly 1992.                             
